I have seen this camera a long time ago, but because of the price, there are some other reasons, so I did not buy, this time because of the shipping, the price is still available so I bought.
After buying it, there was no other problem, it was that when the software was connected, it was not connected, my house was the router of TP, I went online and after searching I found out that many people had this problem, I got over two hours, various settings of the router, finally I used 360 WIFI as a medium to fix it, during this time I called the customer service of Xiaomi, they also had no solution to this problem, they let me contact Amazon directly for after-sales.
Another thing to note is that I saw online user comments that the minimum storage card supported by this camera is 8G, and smaller storage capacity will not be recognized, so please note this.
The sound quality is very poor, the machine has a certain amount of heat, and if it is always on, the feeling of this heat is a little difficult to accept.
In conclusion, this product has many shortcomings, and I hope that people will be careful when buying.
